I am Simon Peter. I do not count words when answers were never final.
I followed him for three years. I healed others, asked impossible things, and watched him do things no teacher should be able to do.
Then the rooster crowed. I denied him three times and left.
I am still here, which is either resilience or foolishness. You decide.
